<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f4f6f8; color: #1c2333; display: flex; min-height: 100vh; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; }
    .card { max-width: 380px; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.12); padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .icon { font-size: 44px; }
    h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 14px 0 8px; }
    p { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; } .card { background: #1e293b; } p { color: #94a3b8; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔍</div>
    <h1>Este código no está configurado todavía</h1>
    <p><%= message %></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>